    {
      "text": "objective function, MBD outperforms RL by 44.5% and 805.5% on average. We also find RL’s",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        332.07305908203125,
        503.9955139160156,
        342.0356750488281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "overall performance is better given the discounted objective while MBD’s performance is better given",
      "bbox": [
