    },
    {
      "text": "should reflect on how these assumptions might be violated in practice and what the",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        386.1663513183594,
        503.999755859375,
        395.0729064941406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "implications would be.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        397.0753479003906,
        254.73956298828125,
        405.9819030761719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should reflect on the scope of the claims made, e.g., if the approach was",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        409.8553466796875,
        503.9949035644531,
        418.76190185546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "only tested on a few datasets or with a few runs. In general, empirical results often",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        420.7643737792969,
        503.999755859375,
        429.6709289550781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "depend on implicit assumptions, which should be articulated.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        431.6733703613281,
        407.5857238769531,
        440.5799255371094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should reflect on the factors that influence the performance of the approach.",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        444.453369140625,
        505.7460632324219,
        453.35992431640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, a facial recognition algorithm may perform poorly when image resolution",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        455.36236572265625,
        504.004638671875,
        464.2689208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is low or images are taken in low lighting. Or a speech-to-text system might not be",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        466.2713623046875,
        503.99981689453125,
        475.17791748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "used reliably to provide closed captions for online lectures because it fails to handle",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        477.18035888671875,
        503.9999084472656,
        486.0869140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "technical jargon.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        488.0903625488281,
        230.01242065429688,
        496.9969177246094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should discuss the computational efficiency of the proposed algorithms",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        500.8693542480469,
        503.9957580566406,
        509.7759094238281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and how they scale with dataset size.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        511.7783203125,
        310.31097412109375,
        520.6848754882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• If applicable, the authors should discuss possible limitations of their approach to",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        524.558349609375,
        503.99981689453125,
        533.4649047851562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "address problems of privacy and fairness.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        535.4673461914062,
        328.4927062988281,
        544.3739013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the authors might fear that complete honesty about limitations might be used by",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        548.2473754882812,
        504.34423828125,
        557.1539306640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reviewers as grounds for rejection, a worse outcome might be that reviewers discover",
      "bbox": [
