        559.1563720703125,
        504.1643981933594,
        568.0629272460938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "limitations that aren’t acknowledged in the paper. The authors should use their best",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        570.0653686523438,
        503.99993896484375,
        578.971923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "judgment and recognize that individual actions in favor of transparency play an impor-",
      "bbox": [
